    "Screenshooter needs authorization to read the pixels of the screen.\n\n1. Go to System Settings > Privacy & Security > Screen Recording and turn on Screenshooter.\n\n2. If you have already turned it on, click 'Restart Screenshooter' so macOS applies the permission." : {
      "comment" : "Alert body explaining how to grant screen recording permission",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Screenshooter needs authorization to read the pixels of the screen.\n\n1. Go to System Settings > Privacy & Security > Screen Recording and turn on Screenshooter.\n\n2. If you have already turned it on, click 'Restart Screenshooter' so macOS applies the permission."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Screenshooter necesita autorización para leer los píxeles de la pantalla.\n\n1. Ve a Ajustes del Sistema > Privacidad y Seguridad > Grabación de Pantalla y activa Screenshooter.\n\n2. Si ya lo has activado, pulsa 'Reiniciar Screenshooter' para que macOS aplique los permisos."
          }
        }
      }
